WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.940
Coding agents write code in minutes. Shipping still takes tickets and coordination.

2
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:09.822
Wait in a queue. Hand over cloud keys. Or write everything yourself.

3
00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.500
You shouldn’t have to pick. Meet Planton.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.390
Proven charts. A short form. Never a blank Terraform file.

5
00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:27.880
Deploys in order, in your AWS account. Terraform state, with history.

6
00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.476
One path. Over eight hundred components, across clouds.

7
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.437
Agents request. Policy decides. A human approves production.

8
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.247
Your cloud. Your keys. Your state. Your bill.
